# Owners — @nexora/persistence

## Code owners

- **Platform Engineering** (Persistence squad) — @nexora/platform-eng
  - owns the Drizzle schema, migrations, and repository implementations
  - approves all schema changes (tenant isolation, index strategy)

## Review requirements

- Schema migrations require an architecture reviewer (PERSISTENCE.md §4
  aggregate ownership; §8 tenant isolation).
- Repository implementations must not leak SQL into domain/application
  layers — the domain ports are the boundary.
- New aggregates require both a domain `hydrate` factory and a migration.

## Areas

| Path                 | Owner                             |
| -------------------- | --------------------------------- |
| `src/schema/`        | Platform Engineering + Architecture |
| `src/repositories/`  | Platform Engineering              |
| `src/hasher/`        | Platform Engineering + Security   |
| `drizzle/`           | Platform Engineering              |
